flowchart TD
  C["Client calls tools/call"] --> S["Server needs a model mid-task"]
  S --> IR["Returns an input request:<br/>a sampling request + state to carry"]
  IR --> H["Client shows the user,<br/>runs the model it chooses"]
  H --> C2["Client calls again with<br/>the model's answer + the state"]
  C2 --> S2{{"Needs another round?"}}
  S2 -->|"yes"| IR
  S2 -->|"no"| R["Final tool result"]
